			<p class="font-body" style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
				Whether you are supplementing an intimate tiered cake with French macarons or curating a legendary 1,000-cookie Pittsburgh wedding spread, mastering dessert proportions is crucial to avoid running out of crowd favorites or wasting hundreds of expensive handcrafted pastries.
			</p>

			<!-- 2-Column Educational Grid -->
